  ($id$coc-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$cociente$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{5^6}{5^3}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"5^3","correct":true},{"latex":"5^9","correct":false},{"latex":"5^2","correct":false},{"latex":"5^{18}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Se restan exponentes: $5^{6-3} = 5^3$.$exp$),
  ($id$coc-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$cociente$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{12x^5}{3x^2}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4x^3","correct":true},{"latex":"9x^3","correct":false},{"latex":"4x^7","correct":false},{"latex":"4x^{\\frac{5}{2}}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Divide coeficientes ($12 \div 3 = 4$) y resta exponentes ($5 - 2 = 3$): $4x^3$.$exp$),
  ($id$coc-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$exponentes$sub$, $law$cociente$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\frac{8x^4 y^3}{2x^2 y}$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4x^2 y^2","correct":true},{"latex":"4x^2 y^3","correct":false},{"latex":"4x^6 y^4","correct":false},{"latex":"6x^2 y^2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Coeficientes: $8 \div 2 = 4$. $x^{4-2} = x^2$, $y^{3-1} = y^2$. Resultado: $4x^2 y^2$.$exp$),
