  ($id$logdef-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$La forma exponencial de $\log_3 9 = 2$ es...$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3^2 = 9","correct":true},{"latex":"2^3 = 9","correct":false},{"latex":"3^9 = 2","correct":false},{"latex":"9^2 = 3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 9 = 2$ significa $3^2 = 9$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_5 5$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_5 5 = 1$ porque $5^1 = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log_x 49 = 2$, ¿cuánto vale $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"7","correct":true},{"latex":"49","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"98","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_x 49 = 2$ significa $x^2 = 49$, por lo que $x = 7$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_3 81$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"4","correct":true},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"27","correct":false},{"latex":"9","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$3^4 = 81$, por lo que $\log_3 81 = 4$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Resuelve: $\log_2 x = 5$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"32","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2 x = 5$ significa $2^5 = x$, por lo que $x = 32$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_{10} 1000$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false},{"latex":"1000","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$10^3 = 1000$, por lo que $\log_{10} 1000 = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logdef-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-definicion$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$La forma logarítmica de $5^2 = 25$ es...$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_5 25 = 2","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2 25 = 5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_5 2 = 25","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2 5 = 25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^2 = 25$ equivale a $\log_5 25 = 2$.$exp$),
