  ($id$logprod-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-producto$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_{10} 2 + \log_{10} 5$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"7","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_{10} 2 + \log_{10} 5 = \log_{10}(2 \cdot 5) = \log_{10} 10 = 1$.$exp$),
