VALUES
  ($id$logcoc-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cociente$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\log_2(x^3/y) - \log_2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log_2(x^2/y)","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^3/y)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^2 y)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^2)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2(x^3/y) - \log_2 x = \log_2\left(\frac{x^3/y}{x}\right) = \log_2(x^2/y)$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcoc-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cociente$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = a$ y $\log 5 = b$, ¿cuánto vale $\log(2/5)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"a - b","correct":true},{"latex":"a + b","correct":false},{"latex":"b - a","correct":false},{"latex":"a / b","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log(2/5) = \log 2 - \log 5 = a - b$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcoc-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cociente$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_3 9 - \log_3 27$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"-1","correct":true},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3 18","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 9 - \log_3 27 = \log_3(9/27) = \log_3(1/3) = -1$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_a(x^n)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"n \\cdot \\log_a x","correct":true},{"latex":"(\\log_a x)^n","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_a(nx)","correct":false},{"latex":"n + \\log_a x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_a(x^n) = n \cdot \log_a x$. El exponente "baja" como factor.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_{10}(10^3)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"30","correct":false},{"latex":"1000","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_{10} 10 + 3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_{10}(10^3) = 3 \cdot \log_{10} 10 = 3 \cdot 1 = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $2 \cdot \log x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log(x^2)","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log(2x)","correct":false},{"latex":"2 + \\log x","correct":false},{"latex":"(\\log x)^2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2 \cdot \log x = \log(x^2)$. El factor entra como exponente.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_2(2^5)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"5","correct":true},{"latex":"32","correct":false},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2(2^5) = 5 \cdot \log_2 2 = 5 \cdot 1 = 5$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Expande: $\log_5 x^3$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3 \\cdot \\log_5 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log_5 x + 3","correct":false},{"latex":"(\\log_5 x)^3","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_5(3x)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_5 x^3 = 3 \cdot \log_5 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log_{10} 100$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$100 = 10^2$, así que $\log_{10} 100 = 2 \cdot \log_{10} 10 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $3 \cdot \log_2 4$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"6","correct":true},{"latex":"12","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2 4 = 2$, así que $3 \cdot 2 = 6$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Expande: $\log_3(x^2 y^3)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2 \\log_3 x + 3 \\log_3 y","correct":true},{"latex":"6 \\log_3(xy)","correct":false},{"latex":"2 \\log_3 x \\cdot 3 \\log_3 y","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3(2x) + \\log_3(3y)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3(x^2 y^3) = \log_3 x^2 + \log_3 y^3 = 2\log_3 x + 3\log_3 y$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\log 1000$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"1000","correct":false},{"latex":"10","correct":false},{"latex":"100","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1000 = 10^3$, así que $\log 1000 = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\log(x^3) - \log(x^2)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\log x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\log(x^6)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log(x^5)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log x + 1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log(x^3) - \log(x^2) = \log(x^3/x^2) = \log x$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = 0.301$, ¿cuánto vale $\log 8$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0.903","correct":true},{"latex":"0.301","correct":false},{"latex":"0.602","correct":false},{"latex":"1.204","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log 8 = \log(2^3) = 3 \cdot \log 2 = 3 \cdot 0.301 = 0.903$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log x = 2$, ¿cuánto vale $\log(x^3)$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"6","correct":true},{"latex":"8","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log(x^3) = 3 \cdot \log x = 3 \cdot 2 = 6$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\log_2(x^4) - 2 \cdot \log_2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2 \\log_2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_2(x^6)","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2(x^4) = 4\log_2 x$. Entonces $4\log_2 x - 2\log_2 x = 2\log_2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 3 = 0.477$, ¿cuánto vale $\log 9$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0.954","correct":true},{"latex":"0.477","correct":false},{"latex":"0.239","correct":false},{"latex":"1.431","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log 9 = \log(3^2) = 2 \cdot \log 3 = 2 \cdot 0.477 = 0.954$.$exp$),
  ($id$logpot-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-potencia$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $2 \cdot \log_5 5 - \log_5 25$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0","correct":true},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"-2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$2 \cdot \log_5 5 = 2 \cdot 1 = 2$ y $\log_5 25 = 2$. Entonces $2 - 2 = 0$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuál es la fórmula del cambio de base?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\log_c b}{\\log_c a}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{\\log_c a}{\\log_c b}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_a b \\cdot \\log_c a","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{\\log_a c}{\\log_b c}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_a b = \frac{\log_c b}{\log_c a}$. El argumento va en el numerador y la base en el denominador.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Expresa $\log_2 5$ en base 10$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\log 5}{\\log 2}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{\\log 2}{\\log 5}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log(5/2)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log 5 \\cdot \\log 2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Usando base 10: $\log_2 5 = \frac{\log 5}{\log 2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_4 16$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"16","correct":false},{"latex":"8","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$4^2 = 16$, por lo que $\log_4 16 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_5 25$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"25","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$5^2 = 25$, por lo que $\log_5 25 = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$El cambio de base a base 10 de $\log_3 9$ es...$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\log 9}{\\log 3}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{\\log 3}{\\log 9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log 6","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log 27","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 9 = \frac{\log 9}{\log 3} = \frac{2}{1} \cdot \frac{\log 3}{\log 3} = 2$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\log_2 8$ usando base 10: $\frac{\log 8}{\log 2} = ?$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"3","correct":true},{"latex":"4","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_2 8 = \frac{\log 8}{\log 2} = \frac{3\log 2}{\log 2} = 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Expresa $\log_5 10$ en base $e$ (natural)$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\ln 10}{\\ln 5}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{\\ln 5}{\\ln 10}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln 2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\ln 50","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Usando base $e$: $\log_5 10 = \frac{\ln 10}{\ln 5}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = 0.301$ y $\log 3 = 0.477$, ¿cuánto vale $\log_3 2$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"0.631","correct":true},{"latex":"1.585","correct":false},{"latex":"0.477","correct":false},{"latex":"0.176","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_3 2 = \frac{\log 2}{\log 3} = \frac{0.301}{0.477} \approx 0.631$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_4 2$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":true},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$4^{1/2} = \sqrt{4} = 2$, por lo que $\log_4 2 = \frac{1}{2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Expresa $\log_7 9$ en base 3$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{\\log_3 9}{\\log_3 7}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{\\log_3 7}{\\log_3 9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3(9/7)","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log_3 63","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_7 9 = \frac{\log_3 9}{\log_3 7}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\log_8 4$ usando cambio de base$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{2}{3}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{3}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_8 4 = \frac{\log 4}{\log 8} = \frac{2\log 2}{3\log 2} = \frac{2}{3}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log 2 = a$, ¿cuánto vale $\log_4 8$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3}{2}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{2}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_4 8 = \frac{\log 8}{\log 4} = \frac{3\log 2}{2\log 2} = \frac{3}{2}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\log_2 7 \cdot \log_7 2$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"\\log 14","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Por cambio de base, $\log_2 7 = \frac{1}{\log_7 2}$, así que su producto es 1.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Calcula $\log_{27} 9$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{2}{3}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{3}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_{27} 9 = \frac{\log 9}{\log 27} = \frac{2\log 3}{3\log 3} = \frac{2}{3}$.$exp$),
  ($id$logcb-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$logaritmos$sub$, $law$log-cambio-base$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\log_x 5 = 2$, ¿cuánto vale $x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sqrt{5}","correct":true},{"latex":"25","correct":false},{"latex":"5","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{5}{2}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\log_x 5 = 2$ significa $x^2 = 5$, por lo que $x = \sqrt{5}$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuál es la identidad pitagórica fundamental?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sin^2 x + \\cos^2 x = 1","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x - \\cos^2 x = 1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x + \\cos^2 x = 0","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin x + \\cos x = 1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$La identidad fundamental es $\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x = 1$. Vale para cualquier ángulo $x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Si $\sin x = \frac{3}{5}$, ¿cuánto vale $\cos^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{16}{25}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{4}{5}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{9}{25}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{25}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\cos^2 x = 1 - \sin^2 x = 1 - \frac{9}{25} = \frac{16}{25}$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-f-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Despeja $\sin^2 x$ de la identidad $\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x = 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sin^2 x = 1 - \\cos^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x = 1 + \\cos^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x = \\cos^2 x - 1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x = \\cos^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Restando $\cos^2 x$ a ambos lados: $\sin^2 x = 1 - \cos^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-f-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿Cuánto vale $\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin 2x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x = 1$ para todo $x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-f-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$Si $\cos x = \frac{1}{2}$, ¿cuánto vale $\sin^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{3}{4}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{4}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{2}","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sin^2 x = 1 - \cos^2 x = 1 - \frac{1}{4} = \frac{3}{4}$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-m-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $1 - \sin^2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\cos^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\cos^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$De $\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x = 1$ se obtiene $1 - \sin^2 x = \cos^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-m-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $1 - \cos^2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sin^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\cos^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"-\\sin^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$De la identidad fundamental: $1 - \cos^2 x = \sin^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $1 + \tan^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sec^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\csc^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\cot^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1 + \tan^2 x = \sec^2 x$ es otra forma de la identidad pitagórica.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\sec^2 x - 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\tan^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\cot^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Como $\sec^2 x = 1 + \tan^2 x$, entonces $\sec^2 x - 1 = \tan^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Si $\tan x = 3$, ¿cuánto vale $\sec^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"10","correct":true},{"latex":"9","correct":false},{"latex":"3","correct":false},{"latex":"4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sec^2 x = 1 + \tan^2 x = 1 + 9 = 10$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x + \tan^2 x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\sec^2 x","correct":true},{"latex":"\\csc^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sin^2 x + \cos^2 x = 1$, así que queda $1 + \tan^2 x = \sec^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\sin x = \frac{5}{13}$ y $x$ está en el primer cuadrante, ¿cuánto vale $\cos x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{12}{13}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{8}{13}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{144}{169}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{12}{169}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\cos^2 x = 1 - \frac{25}{169} = \frac{144}{169}$, y como $x$ está en el primer cuadrante, $\cos x = \frac{12}{13}$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $\sin^2 x\,(1 + \cot^2 x)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"1","correct":true},{"latex":"\\sin^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\cos^2 x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\csc^2 x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1 + \cot^2 x = \csc^2 x$, así que $\sin^2 x \cdot \csc^2 x = \sin^2 x \cdot \frac{1}{\sin^2 x} = 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Si $\cos x = \frac{1}{3}$, ¿cuánto vale $1 - \cos^2 x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{8}{9}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{9}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{2}{3}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{8}{3}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$1 - \cos^2 x = 1 - \frac{1}{9} = \frac{8}{9}$, que es $\sin^2 x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigpit-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-pitagorica$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Simplifica: $(\sin x + \cos x)^2 - 1$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2 \\sin x \\cos x","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"2","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin x \\cos x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$(\sin x + \cos x)^2 = \sin^2 x + 2\sin x \cos x + \cos^2 x = 1 + 2\sin x \cos x$. Al restar 1: $2\sin x \cos x$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigrec-f-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\sec x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\cos x}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\sin x}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\cos x","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\tan x}","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\sec x$ es el recíproco de $\cos x$: $\sec x = \frac{1}{\cos x}$.$exp$),
  ($id$trigrec-f-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$trigonometria$sub$, $law$trig-reciprocas$law$, $diff$easy$diff$, $prompt$¿A qué es igual $\csc x$?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\sin x}","correct":true},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\cos x}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\frac{1}{\\tan x}","correct":false},{"latex":"\\sin x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\csc x$ es el recíproco de $\sin x$: $\csc x = \frac{1}{\sin x}$.$exp$)
