VALUES
  ($id$divpol-m-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(2x^2 + 6x) \div 2x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x + 3","correct":true},{"latex":"x - 3","correct":false},{"latex":"2x + 3","correct":false},{"latex":"x + 6","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{2x^2}{2x} + \frac{6x}{2x} = x + 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-m-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(x^2 - 1) \div (x + 1)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x - 1","correct":true},{"latex":"x + 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 - 1","correct":false},{"latex":"1 - x","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^2 - 1 = (x+1)(x-1)$, así que el cociente es $x-1$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-m-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$medium$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(x^3 - 8) \div (x - 2)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 + 2x + 4","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 - 2x + 4","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 + 2x - 4","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 + 4","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Es una diferencia de cubos: $x^3 - 8 = (x-2)(x^2 + 2x + 4)$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-h-01$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(x^3 - 1) \div (x - 1)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 + x + 1","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 - x + 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 + x - 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x^3 + x + 1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Diferencia de cubos: $x^3 - 1 = (x-1)(x^2 + x + 1)$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-h-02$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(2x^3 + 4x^2 - 6x) \div 2x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 + 2x - 3","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 + 2x + 3","correct":false},{"latex":"2x^2 + 4x - 6","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 - 2x - 3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Divide cada término entre $2x$: $x^2 + 2x - 3$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-h-03$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(x^2 + 1) \div (x - 1)$. ¿Cuál es el residuo?$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"2","correct":true},{"latex":"0","correct":false},{"latex":"1","correct":false},{"latex":"x + 1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$x^2 + 1 = (x-1)(x+1) + 2$, por lo que el residuo es $2$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-h-04$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(x^3 + x^2 - x - 1) \div (x + 1)$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 - 1","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 + 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x - 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x^2 - x + 1","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$Agrupa: $x^2(x+1) - (x+1) = (x+1)(x^2-1)$, así que el cociente es $x^2 - 1$.$exp$),
  ($id$divpol-h-05$id$, $sec$algebra$sec$, $sub$division-polinomios$sub$, $law$division-polinomios$law$, $diff$hard$diff$, $prompt$Divide: $(3x^3 - 3x) \div 3x$$prompt$, $json$[{"latex":"x^2 - 1","correct":true},{"latex":"x^2 + 1","correct":false},{"latex":"x^3 - 1","correct":false},{"latex":"3x^2 - 3","correct":false}]$json$::jsonb, $exp$$\frac{3x^3}{3x} - \frac{3x}{3x} = x^2 - 1$.$exp$)
